      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ACE TO BURN (7) made light work of the tricky draw with a fast early sectional but gathered in and had to settle for the minors, finishing third (18.64) at Dubbo over 318m. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. One of the leading chances. WOOPI BLUEBIRDS (2) was in the minors two back (23.09) at this track but ran below best last time there, finishing 7th. In the mix. PANDORA LASS (1) has been hard to follow lately, running eighth (19.31) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. Can improve sharply here. RED ROCK ALONG (3) was below best last time at this track (19.07) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 10 length fifth. Has two wins already from this draw.",
